# Build context filter for CI/docker/coeus.dockerfile, which is built from the
# repository root (it COPYs CI/coeus and CI/docker/spack.yaml).
#
# The repo root is ~8 GB - test/ alone is 7.9 GB - and all of it would be
# uploaded to the daemon on every build. Exclude everything, then opt the two
# needed paths back in one directory level at a time: neither the legacy builder
# nor BuildKit will descend into a directory excluded without an explicit
# re-include of that directory itself.
#
# NOTE: this is a root .dockerignore, so it applies to ANY image built with the
# repo root as context. Today that is only coeus.dockerfile (.devcontainer builds
# use .devcontainer/ as their context and COPY nothing). If you add another
# root-context image, re-include what it needs here.
*

!CI
CI/*

!CI/coeus

!CI/docker
CI/docker/*
!CI/docker/spack.yaml
